PolyKernel W1 Spike - C++ standard selection (reports/w1_cppstd.log)
================================================================================

RESULT: C++20 OK, fallback to C++17 NOT needed.

The top-level CMakeLists.txt sets:
    set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 20 CACHE STRING "C++ standard to conform to")
    set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD_REQUIRED ON)
    set(CMAKE_CXX_EXTENSIONS OFF)

